/T (MedSimAI empowers medical students to enhance their communication skills by engaging with AI-driven virtual patients in realistic clinical scenarios. By simulating authentic patient interactions and providing personalized feedback, the platform helps students gain confidence in their patient communication abilities to become more experienced doctors. We are developing a new electronic health record and an interactive quiz feature, providing students with an interface that lets them view reports all in one place and test themselves to evaluate their progress.)
